{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Toad Tavern</strong> is a game where you play as a bartender in an illegal speakeasy amidst the 1920s prohibition era in <i>Amphibiopolis</i>. Under your boss and speakeasy owner, Don Pac, your drinks can make this speakeasy a major hop or a major flop.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/steam_page_headers.png?t=1742051525\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a series of simulation-style minigames to craft the perfect drink.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/shaking_gif.gif?t=1742051525\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/steam_page_headers__1_.png?t=1742051525\" /> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new recipes and drink variants as you master the art of bartending.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/olive_drop.gif?t=1742051525\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/steam_page_headers__2_.png?t=1742051525\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve the right drinks and unlock hidden truths about the frogs that frequent the bar.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575570/extras/froggy_clientele.gif?t=1742051525\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575570?t=1742051525","background_raw":"https://store.